1
00:00:08,708 --> 00:00:11,166
Challenge is on.
He's the interschool champion.

2
00:00:26,125 --> 00:00:27,541
Oof!

3
00:00:28,125 --> 00:00:29,291
Good job.

4
00:00:36,916 --> 00:00:38,416
Your brother is not bad.

5
00:00:39,041 --> 00:00:40,291
I just won.

6
00:00:40,375 --> 00:00:41,875
He's good with a racket.

7
00:00:42,416 --> 00:00:45,416
Shame about his background.
Explains his attitude, though.

8
00:00:47,208 --> 00:00:49,041
-What'd you say?
-You heard me.

9
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:51,041
-Say it again.
-Hey!

10
00:00:51,125 --> 00:00:53,208
-Why is he so rude?
-Okay. Okay.

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,875
There are those who are good at games.

12
00:00:57,958 --> 00:00:59,541
And those who complain.

13
00:00:59,625 --> 00:01:01,041
Huh. Speaker's son?

14
00:01:01,541 --> 00:01:03,916
-He started it.
-Here's an idea.

15
00:01:04,416 --> 00:01:07,250
Before you talk nonsense,
count to ten first.

16
00:01:08,416 --> 00:01:09,666
Don't embarrass your family.

17
00:01:11,333 --> 00:01:12,333
Huh?

18
00:01:16,666 --> 00:01:18,375
You're afraid of that guy?

19
00:01:18,458 --> 00:01:20,708
What do you mean?
He's annoyed me for ages.

20
00:01:21,208 --> 00:01:24,333
Anyway, I'll climb higher than him.
He doesn't scare me.

21
00:01:24,416 --> 00:01:25,916
He had a point.

22
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,666
Other people don't see me
as part of the Hsueh family.

23
00:01:30,375 --> 00:01:31,666
Don't talk like that.

24
00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:34,250
Dad'll see how great you are one day.

25
00:01:35,375 --> 00:01:37,666
Then the two of us will do great things.

26
00:01:39,083 --> 00:01:40,166
Like what?

27
00:01:41,083 --> 00:01:43,250
Get your racket out. I'll beat you.

28
00:01:44,583 --> 00:01:47,708
Oh! You wanna get smashed, huh?

29
00:02:03,833 --> 00:02:05,916
I think I got a better plan.

30
00:02:09,375 --> 00:02:11,291
THE FIXERS

31
00:02:28,875 --> 00:02:32,333
BACKSTABBER

32
00:02:32,416 --> 00:02:33,333
HOWIE, MISSED CALL

33
00:02:33,416 --> 00:02:34,625
ONE NEW VOICEMAIL

34
00:02:34,708 --> 00:02:37,250
Dad, get back here.

35
00:02:37,333 --> 00:02:38,750
We're in danger.

36
00:02:46,958 --> 00:02:48,291
Police, how can I help you?

37
00:02:48,375 --> 00:02:49,583
I wanna report a crime.

38
00:03:07,875 --> 00:03:08,958
The boy's innocent.

39
00:03:09,041 --> 00:03:11,583
-He doesn't know anything.
-Give me the right answer.

40
00:03:11,666 --> 00:03:14,875
And I assure you,
we'll leave you to your day.

41
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,375
Police, open up.

42
00:03:22,958 --> 00:03:24,291
Everything all right?

43
00:03:24,375 --> 00:03:26,791
We've had complaints about the noise.

44
00:03:26,875 --> 00:03:29,291
Watch what you say.

45
00:03:29,375 --> 00:03:30,833
Or your son gets hurt.

46
00:03:32,125 --> 00:03:35,291
If someone's in there, open the door now.

47
00:03:35,375 --> 00:03:36,791
All right.

48
00:03:41,583 --> 00:03:43,916
-Hi.
-Neighbors reported a commotion.

49
00:03:44,416 --> 00:03:46,000
A commotion?

50
00:03:46,083 --> 00:03:49,125
I sell products livestream.
I might have got a bit excited.

51
00:03:49,208 --> 00:03:52,916
-Can I take a look?
-Uh, everything's all right.

52
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,625
-Don't trouble yourself, okay?
-I'll be off now.

53
00:03:55,708 --> 00:03:59,166
-Just tell me when the goods get here.
-Mmm. Right.

54
00:04:02,333 --> 00:04:03,916
-All right?
-Everything's fine.

55
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,208
-Keep the noise down.
-Okay, thanks.

56
00:04:09,875 --> 00:04:11,791
Howie? Howie!

57
00:04:11,875 --> 00:04:13,125
Howie, are you all right?

58
00:04:13,208 --> 00:04:15,916
Oh, please don't scare me! Howie!

59
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,333
Please get up.

60
00:04:18,416 --> 00:04:19,833
Answer me!

61
00:04:19,916 --> 00:04:22,625
You're scaring me. Howie!

62
00:04:22,708 --> 00:04:25,375
-Fuck.
-Honey, what do we do?

63
00:04:29,333 --> 00:04:30,666
Tell me who they are.

64
00:04:36,458 --> 00:04:38,125
Okay. Then I'll ring the police.

65
00:04:38,208 --> 00:04:39,875
You can't call the cops.

66
00:04:40,375 --> 00:04:41,875
Why can't I call them?

67
00:04:43,125 --> 00:04:45,416
Tell me what you've been doing out there.

68
00:05:16,625 --> 00:05:20,375
Legislator Chao Ming-cheng's
bribery case continues to escalate.

69
00:05:20,458 --> 00:05:21,916
Ching He's Thackery Huang,

70
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:24,416
initially suspected of being a middleman,

71
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:27,458
now thought to be involved
in a number of cases,

72
00:05:27,541 --> 00:05:30,375
according to the latest evidence
gathered by prosecutors Huang…

73
00:05:30,458 --> 00:05:33,166
Now I want you to give me
a straight answer.

74
00:05:33,250 --> 00:05:34,750
Tell me who these people are.

75
00:05:37,208 --> 00:05:40,000
Once he's awake, we'll get out of here.

76
00:05:41,541 --> 00:05:43,166
What if he can't wake up?

77
00:05:43,666 --> 00:05:46,333
What if our son can't wake up?

78
00:05:47,916 --> 00:05:50,916
You're holding onto so many secrets.

79
00:05:52,416 --> 00:05:55,208
You're not young Gold's
bodyguard, are you?

80
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:03,875
We're partners.

81
00:06:06,208 --> 00:06:07,291
In what, exactly?

82
00:06:09,041 --> 00:06:10,666
We work for Ching He.

83
00:06:11,791 --> 00:06:12,916
Ching He?

84
00:06:13,875 --> 00:06:15,583
Mmm.

85
00:06:18,166 --> 00:06:19,208
So you're back.

86
00:06:19,708 --> 00:06:22,208
We haven't had a drink
together for a while.

87
00:06:22,291 --> 00:06:24,416
Here.

88
00:06:27,083 --> 00:06:28,958
Oh, wait, it's just you and me.

89
00:06:30,083 --> 00:06:31,500
We shouldn't drink this.

90
00:06:39,041 --> 00:06:42,958
So you've decided to help me
with the Primordial Files.

91
00:06:45,125 --> 00:06:48,833
As Dad said, I'm a Hsueh.
Who better to help out?

92
00:06:48,916 --> 00:06:50,583
And the reason I joined Ching He,

93
00:06:51,250 --> 00:06:53,416
it was so I could help the Hsuehs one day.

94
00:06:54,583 --> 00:06:56,250
I knew I could trust you.

95
00:06:57,416 --> 00:07:00,375
I wish Dad was here.
This would make him so happy.

96
00:07:02,166 --> 00:07:04,458
You're not doing this
just for Dad, are you?

97
00:07:05,833 --> 00:07:07,083
It's about what you want.

98
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:14,333
I thought you went into all this
because Dad made you do it.

99
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:17,333
But you love the power.

100
00:07:19,875 --> 00:07:21,208
Hmm.

101
00:07:22,291 --> 00:07:24,541
Look at that bridge.

102
00:07:24,625 --> 00:07:26,791
It connects the two sides of the city.

103
00:07:26,875 --> 00:07:29,583
On one side is power and order.

104
00:07:29,666 --> 00:07:32,458
On the other, opportunity and ambition.

105
00:07:32,958 --> 00:07:36,041
Dad's belief is the two sides
shouldn't be opposed,

106
00:07:36,708 --> 00:07:38,333
that they should coexist.

107
00:07:38,833 --> 00:07:40,333
That's not what I think.

108
00:07:41,125 --> 00:07:43,416
Coexistence is giving in.

109
00:07:44,583 --> 00:07:48,125
In this world, it's the strong
who set the agenda.

110
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,875
The bridge should be blown up.
That's what I'd like to see.

111
00:07:52,458 --> 00:07:53,833
No boundaries.

112
00:07:53,916 --> 00:07:56,166
Everyone following one set agenda.

113
00:07:56,250 --> 00:07:58,375
And I set that one agenda.

114
00:07:59,916 --> 00:08:01,916
I hate relying on Dad too.

115
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,041
I hate being dependent.

116
00:08:04,125 --> 00:08:06,250
I have my own view of the future.

117
00:08:08,125 --> 00:08:10,500
I'll help. But promise me, will you?

118
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:12,833
What?

119
00:08:12,916 --> 00:08:14,625
Don't touch Felix or Mina.

120
00:08:20,208 --> 00:08:25,416
It sounds like there are some things
that Yeh Yueh Tong hasn't told you.

121
00:08:26,250 --> 00:08:28,125
Okay, you got it.

122
00:08:39,583 --> 00:08:40,708
Are you okay?

123
00:08:47,875 --> 00:08:49,583
My son's life was saved.

124
00:08:50,166 --> 00:08:51,625
But he hasn't woken up yet.

125
00:08:51,708 --> 00:08:55,000
The doctor says
the next 48 hours are the most critical.

126
00:08:56,916 --> 00:08:59,541
Thackery was arrested.
I saw it on a news report.

127
00:08:59,625 --> 00:09:02,125
Hmm. There'll be a new leader.

128
00:09:02,208 --> 00:09:05,541
Madam Fan wants to replace Thackery
as the head of Ching He.

129
00:09:07,416 --> 00:09:08,416
So what happened?

130
00:09:08,916 --> 00:09:11,250
Fan's father was the former leader.

131
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:15,875
Now she wants to reclaim
the position she thinks belongs to her.

132
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:19,458
This is for Thackery.

133
00:09:19,541 --> 00:09:21,208
Is it too late to give it to him?

134
00:09:23,333 --> 00:09:24,375
What is it?

135
00:09:24,458 --> 00:09:26,583
Just before Zoe died…

136
00:09:28,125 --> 00:09:29,333
she gave me this.

137
00:09:33,416 --> 00:09:35,708
Did you open it?

138
00:09:36,333 --> 00:09:37,208
I haven't.

139
00:09:38,583 --> 00:09:42,166
But Zoe wanted me to hand this
to Thackery in person.

140
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,750
Give it to me. I'll give it to him.

141
00:09:53,375 --> 00:09:56,708
He's been arrested.
How will you give it to him?

142
00:09:57,416 --> 00:09:59,250
I'm going to visit him in jail.

143
00:10:01,083 --> 00:10:03,875
Zoe said the things on this…

144
00:10:05,541 --> 00:10:07,000
are about the Hsuehs.

145
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:22,000
I just found out the Hsueh family were
responsible for arresting him.

146
00:10:23,041 --> 00:10:27,333
The card's contents could stop Madam Fan
from being Ching He's new leader.

147
00:10:30,083 --> 00:10:32,000
Mmm.

148
00:10:32,083 --> 00:10:33,208
Trust me.

149
00:10:39,041 --> 00:10:40,541
When Howie wakes up.

150
00:10:41,458 --> 00:10:43,583
I'll take him and his mother away.

151
00:10:45,750 --> 00:10:46,666
Hmm.

152
00:10:47,291 --> 00:10:48,583
Far away.

153
00:10:50,083 --> 00:10:50,958
Hmm.

154
00:10:52,333 --> 00:10:53,375
CHING HE TEMPLE

155
00:11:09,583 --> 00:11:11,708
We've managed to detain Thackery.

156
00:11:12,458 --> 00:11:14,083
And you were such a big help.

157
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:18,375
Without you, things wouldn't
have gone so smoothly.

158
00:11:18,875 --> 00:11:23,125
It's time, I think,
for Ching He to embrace the new.

159
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:27,458
You fought valiantly for Ching He
through everything.

160
00:11:27,958 --> 00:11:32,416
I promise you, I will bring
nothing but benefit to Ching He.

161
00:11:34,500 --> 00:11:36,958
From now on,
with the Hsueh family as an ally,

162
00:11:37,541 --> 00:11:39,500
Ching He will be more powerful.

163
00:11:40,875 --> 00:11:43,083
If only Thackery would step down.

164
00:11:44,041 --> 00:11:46,500
With Madam Fan as chair, however,

165
00:11:46,583 --> 00:11:48,666
there still may be some variables.

166
00:11:50,333 --> 00:11:53,833
With the Hsueh family's
assistance, we can certainly grow.

167
00:11:54,416 --> 00:11:57,916
But you need to know
Ching He's neutrality is vital.

168
00:11:58,583 --> 00:12:01,833
I must request that you honor it.

169
00:12:07,666 --> 00:12:10,125
I didn't want to say it before,

170
00:12:10,208 --> 00:12:14,166
but now you're on board,
that won't be an issue.

171
00:12:14,666 --> 00:12:17,791
I heard there were two keys
in the possession of the leader.

172
00:12:18,375 --> 00:12:20,000
Thackery has one of them.

173
00:12:21,541 --> 00:12:23,333
So whereabouts is the other?

174
00:12:28,041 --> 00:12:29,625
I look after it.

175
00:12:32,666 --> 00:12:35,250
Well, are you willing to hand it over?

176
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,583
I can't hand it over right now.

177
00:12:39,416 --> 00:12:42,958
We haven't had the inauguration.
It's not our way.

178
00:12:44,708 --> 00:12:46,000
Sir Hong.

179
00:12:46,791 --> 00:12:49,125
Since we've come this far,

180
00:12:49,625 --> 00:12:51,666
we don't want any mishaps.

181
00:13:01,041 --> 00:13:02,583
I understand.

182
00:13:15,958 --> 00:13:17,625
Do you think he'll hand it over?

183
00:13:18,125 --> 00:13:19,833
If he decides to help me,

184
00:13:20,541 --> 00:13:22,916
I can only applaud his decision.

185
00:13:24,166 --> 00:13:28,166
Sir Hong's family has been
with Ching He for generations.

186
00:13:29,458 --> 00:13:31,625
Each newly appointed leader

187
00:13:31,708 --> 00:13:35,208
needs his assistance,
if they want to get anything done.

188
00:13:36,583 --> 00:13:38,833
That puts my mind at ease.

189
00:13:42,166 --> 00:13:44,500
I heard there are two people

190
00:13:44,583 --> 00:13:46,000
who are causing you trouble.

191
00:13:46,791 --> 00:13:48,791
Who? Say.

192
00:13:49,375 --> 00:13:51,708
Felix Chiang and Mina Shen.

193
00:13:53,458 --> 00:13:56,083
Louis wanted me to get you to spare them.

194
00:13:58,291 --> 00:14:00,458
But he didn't tell me
why you're after them.

195
00:14:01,416 --> 00:14:03,375
So I guess I'm curious.

196
00:14:04,666 --> 00:14:07,708
They know something
to do with an important client.

197
00:14:08,958 --> 00:14:11,125
I had to scare the two of them off.

198
00:14:11,750 --> 00:14:14,583
But, since Louis has asked,

199
00:14:15,166 --> 00:14:16,583
I promise.

200
00:14:16,666 --> 00:14:17,916
How could I turn him down?

201
00:14:22,208 --> 00:14:24,833
I'm curious about Louis.

202
00:14:25,333 --> 00:14:27,375
What role does he have to play?

203
00:14:27,875 --> 00:14:29,833
If Thackery won't step down,

204
00:14:30,625 --> 00:14:31,708
he could help us out there.

205
00:14:33,083 --> 00:14:35,166
This is his condition in exchange.

206
00:14:37,375 --> 00:14:38,791
I understand.

207
00:14:40,041 --> 00:14:41,041
I appreciate that.

208
00:14:42,750 --> 00:14:45,208
You're welcome, Mr. Mayor.

209
00:14:45,291 --> 00:14:47,583
It's a pleasure working with you.

210
00:15:22,708 --> 00:15:24,250
So, what is it you know?

211
00:15:28,291 --> 00:15:29,458
Zoe's dead.

212
00:15:30,125 --> 00:15:32,125
I have something she wanted to give you.

213
00:15:32,791 --> 00:15:35,208
The contents were surprising.

214
00:15:35,291 --> 00:15:37,208
So what's your plan from here?

215
00:15:37,291 --> 00:15:38,666
It's to do with the Hsuehs.

216
00:15:39,916 --> 00:15:41,666
You won't be getting it.

217
00:15:44,166 --> 00:15:45,958
Are you going to betray us?

218
00:15:47,708 --> 00:15:51,333
When I joined Ching He, I said,
"One day, this will help the Hsuehs."

219
00:15:53,458 --> 00:15:55,250
Never thought it would be like this.

220
00:15:58,208 --> 00:15:59,791
I need to tell you

221
00:16:00,625 --> 00:16:03,833
I always knew who your family was.

222
00:16:04,791 --> 00:16:06,666
So why did I let you join Ching He?

223
00:16:07,250 --> 00:16:09,000
To get at the Hsueh clan.

224
00:16:10,375 --> 00:16:12,000
You're not like your brother.

225
00:16:14,208 --> 00:16:15,541
All this time,

226
00:16:16,208 --> 00:16:20,416
your continued performance for Ching He
has never disappointed me.

227
00:16:21,208 --> 00:16:22,375
Even now,

228
00:16:23,291 --> 00:16:24,666
I can see

229
00:16:26,416 --> 00:16:31,208
you're still the Louis who turned up
at my door all those years ago.

230
00:16:32,958 --> 00:16:34,083
You sure of that?

231
00:16:37,791 --> 00:16:40,208
My brother's made a tempting offer.

232
00:16:40,833 --> 00:16:43,000
I'm a Hsueh at heart, you know.

233
00:16:46,125 --> 00:16:47,291
If you'll step down,

234
00:16:48,125 --> 00:16:50,208
I can guarantee your safety.

235
00:16:52,166 --> 00:16:54,166
You don't have to bother.

236
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,583
I know my time's over.

237
00:16:57,875 --> 00:17:00,583
I just hope Ching He can survive.

238
00:17:01,833 --> 00:17:04,833
If I have to step down, I'll step down.

239
00:17:06,166 --> 00:17:10,833
But if the Primordial Files are
controlled by the wrong individual,

240
00:17:12,166 --> 00:17:15,583
the balance of the scales
will be disturbed.

241
00:17:16,833 --> 00:17:19,458
And the genie won't go back in the bottle.

242
00:17:19,958 --> 00:17:22,166
Let the next head of Ching He
worry about that.

243
00:17:22,666 --> 00:17:26,375
What happens when
the Hsueh family find out about the video?

244
00:17:27,333 --> 00:17:30,041
They must find out who else knows.

245
00:17:30,125 --> 00:17:32,125
And do you think they'll be spared?

246
00:17:37,291 --> 00:17:39,625
Since Tristan's taking an interest,

247
00:17:40,416 --> 00:17:42,333
remember, keep it clean.

248
00:17:44,833 --> 00:17:49,375
Anyone with knowledge
of the Hsueh family secret,

249
00:17:50,041 --> 00:17:52,750
they cannot live, you hear me?

250
00:17:53,541 --> 00:17:54,625
Yes, ma'am.

251
00:17:57,541 --> 00:17:59,875
-You feeling better?
-Young Gold?

252
00:17:59,958 --> 00:18:03,750
The doctor says it's not serious
and his brain's all right.

253
00:18:03,833 --> 00:18:05,833
A little longer and they'll discharge him.

254
00:18:06,458 --> 00:18:08,166
I'll see what I can arrange.

255
00:18:08,250 --> 00:18:10,500
-I know the head of neurology here.
-Oh.

256
00:18:10,583 --> 00:18:12,875
Why haven't you been
to our house for dinner lately?

257
00:18:12,958 --> 00:18:15,125
Now, now. You be polite.

258
00:18:15,916 --> 00:18:17,916
I will when you've recovered.

259
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,958
But the house isn't safe right now.

260
00:18:20,625 --> 00:18:22,791
That won't happen again. Don't worry.

261
00:18:23,333 --> 00:18:24,458
Uh…

262
00:18:24,541 --> 00:18:26,375
Are you here for my husband?

263
00:18:26,458 --> 00:18:28,083
Hasn't he told you he's quitting?

264
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:32,000
We're parting ways.

265
00:18:32,083 --> 00:18:33,333
I can handle the rest.

266
00:18:38,291 --> 00:18:39,291
Why are you here?

267
00:18:51,333 --> 00:18:52,791
Have you seen Thackery?

268
00:18:55,208 --> 00:18:58,125
He's retiring. Fan will take over.

269
00:18:59,791 --> 00:19:01,541
Did he choose to step down?

270
00:19:02,541 --> 00:19:04,291
It's not his choice to make.

271
00:19:07,541 --> 00:19:10,291
And the footage. Did you give it to him?

272
00:19:12,458 --> 00:19:14,833
You know about the video,
so you're in danger.

273
00:19:14,916 --> 00:19:18,375
But Madame Fan's not in charge yet.
You need to go.

274
00:19:18,958 --> 00:19:22,458
-Take your family and leave.
-So you didn't give him the footage?

275
00:19:24,958 --> 00:19:26,833
And now you wanna help out.

276
00:19:27,333 --> 00:19:29,750
Help the Hsueh family and Fan
take over Ching He.

277
00:19:29,833 --> 00:19:33,375
This is not your concern.
You must leave here.

278
00:19:34,708 --> 00:19:37,125
Do you appreciate how many have been hurt?

279
00:19:37,208 --> 00:19:38,208
Huh?

280
00:19:38,291 --> 00:19:40,916
Fuck, I trusted you like you're a brother.

281
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,125
Fuck!

282
00:19:42,208 --> 00:19:43,500
This is for my son.

283
00:19:43,583 --> 00:19:45,666
For Zoe and her daughter.

284
00:19:45,750 --> 00:19:46,750
And Ben!

285
00:19:47,791 --> 00:19:52,000
Did so many people have to suffer and die
just so you could be Ching He's chairman?

286
00:19:52,083 --> 00:19:54,083
Fucking bastard.

287
00:20:06,916 --> 00:20:08,583
Get away with your family.

288
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,666
Fuck.

289
00:20:24,458 --> 00:20:26,708
-Where's your mom?
-She's gone out.

290
00:20:26,791 --> 00:20:28,333
She's looking for food.

291
00:20:28,833 --> 00:20:29,958
Oh.

292
00:20:30,041 --> 00:20:31,250
Why are you reading?

293
00:20:31,333 --> 00:20:32,333
Doesn't your head hurt?

294
00:20:32,416 --> 00:20:34,625
When I'm discharged, I'll have exams.

295
00:20:38,250 --> 00:20:39,625
I've failed you both.

296
00:20:40,166 --> 00:20:42,000
I couldn't protect you and your mom.

297
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:44,041
Now, you should know,

298
00:20:44,125 --> 00:20:45,833
if this happens again,

299
00:20:45,916 --> 00:20:47,708
you just need to get out.

300
00:20:47,791 --> 00:20:49,416
Run like the wind, okay?

301
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:50,625
Dad.

302
00:20:51,125 --> 00:20:52,458
If it was you,

303
00:20:52,958 --> 00:20:54,708
you would have protected Mom.

304
00:20:55,375 --> 00:20:58,916
But I know you've got
important stuff to deal with right now.

305
00:21:02,458 --> 00:21:04,750
-Has he gone?
-He has.

306
00:21:05,333 --> 00:21:06,208
Hey.

307
00:21:06,708 --> 00:21:09,041
Can you handle
how he's discharged tomorrow?

308
00:21:09,125 --> 00:21:10,333
Then let's get out of here.

309
00:21:10,833 --> 00:21:13,291
Did you and your partner have a fight?

310
00:21:13,791 --> 00:21:15,291
Get out of here where?

311
00:21:15,916 --> 00:21:17,708
And for how long?

312
00:21:18,958 --> 00:21:20,625
It's one thing for the two of us,

313
00:21:20,708 --> 00:21:23,500
but does our son have
to live in hiding as well?

314
00:21:31,166 --> 00:21:32,666
Deal with this now.

315
00:21:33,625 --> 00:21:36,083
You leave it any longer,
your hands will get worse,

316
00:21:36,166 --> 00:21:37,791
and then where will you be?

317
00:21:45,958 --> 00:21:47,708
We've known each other a long time.

318
00:21:48,291 --> 00:21:50,833
I know every little piece of you.

319
00:21:50,916 --> 00:21:52,083
And I know

320
00:21:52,875 --> 00:21:54,708
that you're looking after
Chi's daughter.

321
00:21:56,625 --> 00:21:58,166
And I'm so angry.

322
00:21:58,250 --> 00:22:01,000
I'm so angry
that you've said nothing about it.

323
00:22:03,625 --> 00:22:06,125
When Howie's discharged in a few days,

324
00:22:06,208 --> 00:22:08,375
I'm gonna take him back
to my mother's place.

325
00:22:08,958 --> 00:22:11,916
So, until then, you sort this out.

326
00:22:13,083 --> 00:22:14,750
And then come home safe.

327
00:22:14,833 --> 00:22:16,875
Do you hear me?

328
00:22:23,583 --> 00:22:24,916
Don't worry, Dad.

329
00:22:25,416 --> 00:22:26,750
Until you get back,

330
00:22:26,833 --> 00:22:28,750
I'll look after your wife for you.

331
00:22:28,833 --> 00:22:30,000
Oh, don't do that.

332
00:22:30,083 --> 00:22:31,583
You sound just like your dad.

333
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:07,958
It's gonna be okay. Hang in there.

334
00:23:08,041 --> 00:23:09,541
Hang in there, you hear me?

335
00:23:09,625 --> 00:23:12,333
You and me. We'll finish it right here.

336
00:24:23,625 --> 00:24:28,250
Bless me, please, Lord Guan,
so we can get out of this.

337
00:24:45,166 --> 00:24:46,875
Deal with it.

338
00:24:47,500 --> 00:24:48,375
All right.

339
00:24:59,333 --> 00:25:01,833
Swamp Eel! It's been a while.

340
00:25:02,708 --> 00:25:05,583
You're an old man now.
Why are you still running?

341
00:25:06,291 --> 00:25:07,875
Is your boss around?

342
00:25:13,250 --> 00:25:15,125
I'm here to ask for a favor.

343
00:25:16,958 --> 00:25:17,958
A favor for who?

344
00:25:18,041 --> 00:25:19,291
An old friend.

345
00:25:20,041 --> 00:25:21,208
Thackery Huang.

346
00:25:22,708 --> 00:25:23,833
Hmm.

347
00:25:24,375 --> 00:25:26,375
How do you want me to help you?

348
00:25:27,625 --> 00:25:30,083
We need to stop Fan taking over Ching He.

349
00:25:33,333 --> 00:25:34,791
You gotta be joking.

350
00:25:34,875 --> 00:25:37,291
You wanna drag San He into this mess?

351
00:25:37,375 --> 00:25:39,666
If San He gets involved,

352
00:25:40,208 --> 00:25:42,875
that's declaring war on the Hsueh clan.

353
00:25:42,958 --> 00:25:44,416
As well as Yeh Yueh Tong.

354
00:25:48,208 --> 00:25:52,000
Don't forget, It was you guys
who toppled Fan's father

355
00:25:52,083 --> 00:25:53,500
and made Thackery chairman.

356
00:25:53,583 --> 00:25:58,333
So if you now let Madame Fan take control,

357
00:25:58,833 --> 00:26:00,375
you could be in trouble.

358
00:26:03,291 --> 00:26:05,208
She's the kind of operator

359
00:26:05,833 --> 00:26:07,791
that you don't wanna fuck with.

360
00:26:13,958 --> 00:26:15,625
If we have to fight dirty.

361
00:26:16,291 --> 00:26:17,833
then it's a whole other story.

362
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:24,916
ARCADE

363
00:26:34,666 --> 00:26:36,333
Did Louis send you here?

364
00:26:37,708 --> 00:26:38,708
No he didn't.

365
00:26:39,375 --> 00:26:40,875
I wanted to see you.

366
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:43,208
We have a common enemy.

367
00:26:44,166 --> 00:26:45,958
You and me, let's take out Fan.

368
00:26:48,583 --> 00:26:50,416
-Why?
-Huh.

369
00:26:50,500 --> 00:26:53,208
That fucker, she hurt my son.

370
00:26:59,125 --> 00:27:01,708
At least you still have people to protect.

371
00:27:07,166 --> 00:27:09,750
That's fine. It was a mistake to come.

372
00:27:10,250 --> 00:27:12,208
Ben wouldn't want you avenging him.

373
00:27:13,666 --> 00:27:14,916
I'll join you.

374
00:27:17,583 --> 00:27:20,208
My partners know I won't let this rest.

375
00:27:21,500 --> 00:27:25,583
At worst, when we see each other again,
they'll give me attitude.

376
00:27:37,166 --> 00:27:38,625
We're here to see a patient.

377
00:27:38,708 --> 00:27:41,500
-How many times do I tell you?
-You can't, unless you're family.

378
00:27:41,583 --> 00:27:43,333
Since when was that a rule?

379
00:27:43,416 --> 00:27:45,541
-Please be quiet.
-It's okay, I'll go.

380
00:27:45,625 --> 00:27:48,291
Don't be like that.
You're treating us like debt collectors.

381
00:27:48,375 --> 00:27:50,291
You look like debt collectors.

382
00:27:50,375 --> 00:27:52,041
Debt collectors don't bring fruit!

383
00:27:52,125 --> 00:27:53,750
-I can't let you in.
-How are you?

384
00:27:53,833 --> 00:27:54,833
Uh, hello.

385
00:27:54,916 --> 00:27:56,750
Don't worry, nurse, we know each other.

386
00:27:57,625 --> 00:28:00,083
Smile, guys, you gave her
the wrong idea. Lighten up.

387
00:28:00,166 --> 00:28:02,125
-Ma'am.
-Tell them to keep their voices down.

388
00:28:02,208 --> 00:28:04,375
Thanks for all your hard work.

389
00:28:05,791 --> 00:28:09,416
Uh… so you're here
and you brought a party?

390
00:28:09,500 --> 00:28:13,041
Pond Loach has lots of things
he has to do, so he called me.

391
00:28:13,125 --> 00:28:14,666
-For safety.
-Aah.

392
00:28:15,541 --> 00:28:16,416
Where's the box?

393
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:17,875
-Oh.
-Idiot!.

394
00:28:17,958 --> 00:28:20,208
-You were supposed to bring it inside!
-You shouldn't have.

395
00:28:32,083 --> 00:28:36,250
Why do you eat tien-bu-la with
just blood pudding and deep-fried tofu?

396
00:28:37,833 --> 00:28:39,583
When my parents passed away,

397
00:28:39,666 --> 00:28:41,458
I had to live with my aunt.

398
00:28:41,958 --> 00:28:45,083
She always cooked radish
and pork meatball soup.

399
00:28:47,708 --> 00:28:49,625
Oh. I heard Ben talk about it.

400
00:28:50,625 --> 00:28:52,583
That big mouth.

401
00:28:54,041 --> 00:28:58,333
My retirement plan was to open a stall
next to his selling swamp eel.

402
00:28:58,416 --> 00:28:59,916
He hated the idea.

403
00:29:01,750 --> 00:29:04,666
Before he died, he mentioned the stall.

404
00:29:06,916 --> 00:29:09,041
He wanted to talk to you about it.

405
00:29:30,166 --> 00:29:33,916
I'm sure you invited me here
for more than small talk, right?

406
00:29:35,166 --> 00:29:36,875
Word on the street is

407
00:29:37,458 --> 00:29:42,583
you're planning to replace Thackery
as Ching He's new leader.

408
00:29:42,666 --> 00:29:43,916
That true or not?

409
00:29:46,208 --> 00:29:48,333
That information spread quickly.

410
00:29:49,041 --> 00:29:51,916
So it appears San He knows
what's going on.

411
00:29:53,250 --> 00:29:55,166
This is a big deal for us.

412
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:57,791
No matter who's chair.

413
00:29:57,875 --> 00:29:59,875
If we have any issues now,

414
00:30:00,375 --> 00:30:02,875
we'll be coming to Ching He for help.

415
00:30:04,500 --> 00:30:05,583
Of course.

416
00:30:13,875 --> 00:30:15,833
We each hold our positions.

417
00:30:15,916 --> 00:30:18,125
As soon as we see an opportunity, shoot.

418
00:30:18,625 --> 00:30:21,833
If one of us fails,
there'll still be a second chance.

419
00:30:23,583 --> 00:30:25,708
I don't have a clear shot.

420
00:30:26,208 --> 00:30:30,208
San He has always had
good relations with Ching He.

421
00:30:30,291 --> 00:30:33,250
But remember, it was my father,

422
00:30:33,333 --> 00:30:36,458
despite opposition, who fought for you.

423
00:30:36,958 --> 00:30:39,208
You must recall all that.

424
00:30:39,291 --> 00:30:40,750
Of course I do.

425
00:30:40,833 --> 00:30:43,125
My brother respected your father.

426
00:30:44,125 --> 00:30:45,250
He's in our hearts.

427
00:30:47,333 --> 00:30:49,500
Then why were you unappreciative?

428
00:30:54,208 --> 00:30:55,875
I recall how

429
00:30:55,958 --> 00:30:58,000
you even conspired with Thackery

430
00:30:58,083 --> 00:31:01,125
to accuse me of killing our own fixer.

431
00:31:03,125 --> 00:31:05,333
I hope you don't plan to repeat that.

432
00:31:25,583 --> 00:31:27,833
Put down the gun or I'll shoot.

433
00:31:38,416 --> 00:31:39,708
You'll never kill her.

434
00:31:51,250 --> 00:31:54,333
So this is San He showing its gratitude.

435
00:31:54,416 --> 00:31:56,833
Huh. Now, just wait.

436
00:31:56,916 --> 00:31:59,125
There's been a misunderstanding.

437
00:31:59,208 --> 00:32:01,625
Hey, go check. Get down there.

438
00:32:08,333 --> 00:32:10,000
Next time, come to my place.

439
00:32:12,416 --> 00:32:14,125
It's safer there.

440
00:32:18,833 --> 00:32:21,291
I'll leave them to catch up down there.

441
00:32:46,208 --> 00:32:49,916
Damn. We won't get a chance
like that again. Fuck.

442
00:33:02,458 --> 00:33:03,708
Sir Hong.

443
00:33:04,416 --> 00:33:06,000
You're a traitor as well.

444
00:33:10,458 --> 00:33:12,041
Here's to my succession.

445
00:33:12,916 --> 00:33:15,833
Everything else, we've taken care of.

446
00:33:16,625 --> 00:33:18,833
Thank you for your support.

447
00:33:19,333 --> 00:33:22,166
And to your brother. For all his help.

448
00:33:29,541 --> 00:33:31,416
Now everything's in place.

449
00:33:31,500 --> 00:33:33,375
We're just waiting
on the succession ceremony.

450
00:33:36,166 --> 00:33:40,291
Knowing Thackery as I do,
he won't comply so easily.

451
00:33:41,125 --> 00:33:43,666
My concern is that once he gets out,

452
00:33:44,458 --> 00:33:46,083
he'll give us trouble.

453
00:33:50,875 --> 00:33:54,375
I would like to know
where that key was hidden.

454
00:33:54,458 --> 00:33:57,833
Thackery's ring. That's his key.

455
00:33:59,458 --> 00:34:01,916
It's just that the ring hasn't been found.

456
00:34:02,416 --> 00:34:03,375
If Thackery hid it,

457
00:34:04,250 --> 00:34:06,625
Sir Hong will know all there is to know.

458
00:34:07,125 --> 00:34:09,666
As the most dangerous place is
often the safest,

459
00:34:09,750 --> 00:34:11,291
I'd say it's in Ching He.

460
00:34:17,500 --> 00:34:21,583
Your brother's been telling me
that you've helped him out a lot.

461
00:34:25,291 --> 00:34:26,416
That's good.

462
00:34:27,333 --> 00:34:29,000
You've finally come around.

463
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:40,833
Isn't this what you really wanted?

464
00:34:41,666 --> 00:34:45,750
Tristan can finally carry on
the Hsueh family legacy for you.

465
00:34:48,916 --> 00:34:50,333
I'm sure you know

466
00:34:51,166 --> 00:34:54,541
a lot of people want
to use the Hsuehs to climb the ladder.

467
00:34:55,708 --> 00:34:58,208
Or to take over from us.

468
00:35:01,291 --> 00:35:02,166
Dad.

469
00:35:02,708 --> 00:35:05,916
If Tristan takes the wrong path
to get to the top,

470
00:35:06,875 --> 00:35:08,416
will you still support him?

471
00:35:10,625 --> 00:35:14,083
I'm the one
who set your brother on this journey.

472
00:35:15,708 --> 00:35:17,291
If he veers the wrong way,

473
00:35:18,250 --> 00:35:20,916
then I have
to take responsibility for that.

474
00:35:21,416 --> 00:35:23,208
Who's really in charge here?

475
00:35:24,500 --> 00:35:27,291
We're all working for the Hsueh clan.

476
00:35:29,333 --> 00:35:32,791
To look after our interests, sometimes

477
00:35:33,333 --> 00:35:35,666
you have to get rid of a few obstacles.

478
00:35:36,500 --> 00:35:38,208
It's for the greater good.

479
00:35:42,125 --> 00:35:43,208
Louis.

480
00:35:45,291 --> 00:35:46,666
I don't have long.

481
00:35:47,500 --> 00:35:49,708
The path your brother takes,

482
00:35:50,291 --> 00:35:52,708
that depends on your efforts.

483
00:35:54,958 --> 00:35:56,458
It's all right, Dad.

484
00:35:57,500 --> 00:36:00,375
Leave it to your sons. Get some rest.

485
00:36:20,708 --> 00:36:23,000
INVITATION, CHING HE
FIXER CELESTIAL INAUGURATION

486
00:37:04,250 --> 00:37:06,708
CELESTIAL, EARTH, SOLAR, LUNAR
